= Incentive — Simple =

An incentive changes the reasons an actor has to choose one action instead of another. Money can be an incentive, but so can reputation, access, penalties, convenience, status, or future opportunity. The intended incentive and the actual effect can differ.

'''Important boundary:''' incentive ≠ reward only.

